  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Forge/Fabric</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>1.16.5 -&gt; 1.21</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組包含2023年生物投票中的螃蟹生物。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">關於螃蟹：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 受到攻擊時有25%機率掉落蟹鉗</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 螃蟹會在5-10分鐘後重新長出蟹鉗</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 手持蟹鉗可放置/擊打更遠的方塊（+4格距離），並會消耗耐久度</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 蟹鉗可烹煮食用</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 能夠攀爬方塊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 生成於紅樹林沼澤生態域</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可用海草吸引並繁殖</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感謝下載此模組！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=320\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/898/262/638343732455468022.gif\"></p>",
